#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Paper results package (A6, D47 (5)): p2/combination/paper/ . ONE command regenerates everything: `bash p2/combination/paper/regenerate.sh` (or python3 -P make_paper.py under the LCG stack).
Every number in a table or figure goes through reg(key, value, source) and is stored in paper_numbers.json with {value, source json path/key, script}; tables take their numbers ONLY from the registry (fmt(key)); figures plot registered arrays.
Sources: WH (wh/work/...*_v12.json, wh/work/sel/selection_v12.json, SAMPLES.csv), ZH (vh_ws/zh_paper_inputs.json, zh_channel_inputs.json), VH (vh_z0mu_*, vh_map2d_*, couplings_vh*_v12.json). Missing inputs are written as '--' and listed in paper_numbers.json['_missing']."""
